# Never send local credentials, private knowledge or diagnostics to the build.
**/.venv*/
**/node_modules/
**/data/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.env*
**/.jwt_secret
**/.test_account_key
test_knowledge/config.yml
test_knowledge/INDEX.md
test_knowledge/features/
test_knowledge/common/
test_knowledge/notes/
notes/
sab-*-bridge*.json
